3_0\">comparisons</span>.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 2", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": " You use superlatives to compare more than two things. When comparing just two things, you use the comparative.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Listen to the audio. Type in the missing words.\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "TYP", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "stimuli_ids": [2], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Date", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Greeting:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Topic Sentence:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 3}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Body of Diary Entry:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Concluding Sentence:", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 5}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\n<span class=\"strong\">You have tickets to one of the most popular musical events in your city. Who are you taking?</span>\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\nInstructions:\n<br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write a 120-150 word diary entry about going to a music festival or concert.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Include a date and a greeting.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Start with a topic sentence that explains what the diary entry will be about.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Where was the event located? Provide a description.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Who did you go with? Friends or family?</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When did you arrive? Early in the morning? Late at night?</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Describe the music, the sounds and the people around you.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Did you sing along? Did you dance? Was there crowd-surfing?</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use 2 superlatives in the diary entry.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write a concluding sentence to sum up your experience.</span><br/>\n\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. </span>\n\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">My Diary Entry on Music and Socializing</span>\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "You are done!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">It's time to review your diary entry.</span>\n<br/><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\nWhen you are writing your diary entry, remember to include:<br/>\n\n\n<ul><li>The date and a greeting.</li>\n<li>A topic sentence and concluding sentence.</li>\n<li>A description of the event that answers who, what, when, where and why questions.</li>\n<li>An expression of feeling.</li></ul>\n\nProofread your diary entry for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.<br/>\n\nRead your diary entry aloud to a partner.<br/><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save your work.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"