}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le07ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Who's that?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: On the radio. I heard that song at Hannibal's last weekend.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That club on 14th Avenue next to the tastiest pizza place in town, Pizzario's?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This music is not as loud as the music you usually listen to. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, I think I've got great taste in music.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmmm ... What time are we meeting Sarah and Gary tomorrow morning?<br />", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le07ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I told them 8 a.m. sharp at gate 401.  We need to be as close as possible to the action. Some bands will ask you to join them on stage. There's even crowd-surfing.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you want to be flung in the air, fine by me.  My feet will be firmly planted on the ground.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh come on ... Where is your sense of adventure?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I heard that the Coachanga arts and music festival is usually packed. The ticket agent said it was one of the most popular events of the year.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's almost as popular as going to Fenway Park to watch a baseball game.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think it's more popular ... Especially if you're not a sports fan. So, what did you decide to buy at the shoe store?<br />", "id": 2, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn8le07ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Open the bag\u2026 They were the prettiest ones in the store.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, where on earth are you going to wear these? You know what they remind me of ...<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My old silver flip-flops right? After I lost them on my trip, I've been looking for replacements.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sal, silver stilettos with diamantes? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, aren't they fabulous? I'm going to be the most fashionable person  there.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: These high-heels are as frightening as your flip-flops. This is the silliest purchase ever! Enter through gate 402, not 401 like the rest of us ...<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not funny!", "id": 3, "time": "65000", "image": "engenn8le07ob08re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "A Dairy Entry about Socializing and Music", "id": 1, "time": "4000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Include the date and a greeting.</li>", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Include a topic sentence.</li>", "id": 3, "time": "21000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Add supporting sentences and details.</li>", "id": 4, "time": "33000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<li>Finish off the paragraph.</li>", "id": 5, "time": "79500", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn8le07ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}